
# Environment Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5041
@apiPath = /api/game
@accept = application/json
@testMatchId = 1
@testPlayer1 = alice
@testPlayer2 = bob
@aiPlayer = AI

### Get Player Hand
# Retrieves the current user's hand for a match (identity comes from the JWT,
# so there is no playerId in the URL).
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/match/{{testMatchId}}/hand
Accept: {{accept}}
{{authHeader}}

###

### Get Player 2 Hand
# Same endpoint — the server resolves the caller from the Bearer token.
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPath}}/match/{{testMatchId}}/hand
Accept: {{accept}}
{{authHeader}}

###
